  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.8 - Enhanced Hangfire RecurringJobId Detection\n• FIXED: Improved RecurringJobId extraction from Hangfire job context\n• ADDED: Multiple fallback methods to detect recurring job ID\n• ADDED: Direct Hangfire storage inspection for job relationships\n• IMPROVED: Enhanced logging for debugging ping failures\n• FIXED: Now correctly links background job executions to their recurring job parents\n• STABLE: Production-tested fix for Hangfire monitoring",
